# Prompt Template (Preserves DeepSeek special tokens & FIM fill-in-the-middle)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TEMPLATE """{{- if .Suffix }}<｜fim▁begin｜>{{ .Prompt }}<｜fim▁hole｜>{{ .Suffix }}<｜fim▁end｜>
{{- else if .Messages }}<｜begin▁of▁sentence｜>
